{
  "uid": "hh-booking-clicks",
  "title": "Booking clicks",
  "description": "Clicks on the Book now CTAs, counted server-side by the /go/airbnb Worker and written to the booking_clicks Analytics Engine dataset. blob1 is the ?src= page path, blob2 the referrer, blob3 the country, blob4 the ?pos= placement (\"inline\" for the {{< book >}} shortcode, \"rail\" for the sticky card on every post, \"unknown\" for rows written before it existed). No panel here reads blob4 yet.\n\nThe Conversion row joins these clicks against Web Analytics visits from Cloudflare's GraphQL API. Those panels count only clicks carrying a blob4 placement, which excludes probes and the canary; the panels above them do not, so their totals differ and the difference is test traffic.",
  "tags": [
    "highland-hideaway",
    "cloudflare"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 4,
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Clicks in range",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "cf-analytics-engine"
      },
      "options": {
